# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# Obsidian / VS Code：vault 入口是 wiki/（D-59），仓库根那份 .obsidian 已退役（D-61）
# 共享配置（.obsidian/*.json）照常入库，只挡每人的会话状态；插件二进制从社区商店可重下，不入库
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/graph.json
**/.obsidian/cache
**/.obsidian/plugins/
**/.obsidian/*.old
.vscode/*.log

# large binaries kept out of the doc set by size, not by secrecy (D-21):
# force-add with `git add -f <path>` when one genuinely belongs in the repo
*.tar
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar
*.iso
*.img
*.bit
*.hdf

# local scaffolding and superseded originals
/build-notes/

# FPGA build outputs
build-x86/
build-arm/
board-pkg/
sim.out
*.vcd

# python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

